nixos-dotfiles
==============

NixOS configuration for a single machine, an Acer Aspire E1-471 laptop
(host "nixosbtw", user "iuno"). It is a flake; home-manager is used as a
NixOS module, so one rebuild applies both the system and the home config.

Layout
------

    flake.nix                    inputs and the nixosConfigurations entry
    configuration.nix            system configuration
    hardware-configuration.nix   generated by nixos-generate-config
    home/                        home-manager configuration
    modules/                     system modules

Desktop: niri (Wayland), foot terminal, yazi, zsh.
Editor: Neovim via nvf (home/nvf).

Building
--------

    git add .
    doas nixos-rebuild build  --flake .
    doas nixos-rebuild switch --flake .

Flakes only read files tracked by git, so new files must be added
before building. Run "build" first; it changes nothing on the system.

Updating
--------

    nix flake update
    nix store diff-closures /run/current-system ./result

Updates can pull a lot of data. Check the size first on a slow link.

Notes
-----

This is a personal configuration. It is published as an example, not as
a supported project. Take what is useful.

